17:T4b6,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the IsDB–YTB scholarship open now?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The reviewed 2026 period ended on 20 February 2026. This guide confirms no open 2027 joint call; check the named official announcement."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Pakistani students apply for every IsDB–YTB degree?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Do not assume so. Pakistan appears in the reviewed attachment’s PhD country group. Eligibility for another degree must be checked in that degree’s own list."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I apply through a separate IsDB portal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The reviewed 2026 joint notice directed applications through Türkiye Scholarships and its Joint Scholarship Programs selection. Follow the next named call for future instructions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a general IsDB scholarship announcement the same programme?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Verify that the notice explicitly names the YTB–IsDB joint route. Other IsDB programmes can have different years, eligibility, funding and obligations."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/isdb-ytb/\",\"name\":\"IsDB–YTB joint scholarship: eligibility and application route\",\"description\":\"Check the IsDB–YTB joint scholarship’s 2026 closed status, degree-specific country list, coverage and TBBS route without assuming a 2027 call is open.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/isdb-ytb/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-29\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-29\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/o