1e:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Check country eligibility at the degree level",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check country eligibility at the degree level"}],[["$","p","The attachment linked from the 2026 notice lists associate/bachelor’s and master’s country groups separately from PhD eligibility. For example, Pakistan and Indonesia appear in the PhD country group; that does not establish access to every undergraduate or master’s route.",{"children":"The attachment linked from the 2026 notice lists associate/bachelor’s and master’s country groups separately from PhD eligibility. For example, Pakistan and Indonesia appear in the PhD country group; that does not establish access to every undergraduate or master’s route."}],["$","p","Use a three-part check: your country, intended degree and the eligible field/programme. If one part does not match, do not infer eligibility from IsDB membership alone. When a new call appears, repeat this check because the attachment can change.",{"children":"Use a three-part check: your country, intended degree and the eligible field/programme. If one part does not match, do not infer eligibility from IsDB membership alone. When a new call appears, repeat this check because the attachment can change."}],["$","p","Original case: a Pakistani applicant seeking a master’s sees Pakistan in the document’s PhD section. They should not treat that entry as a master’s entitlement. They need the relevant degree section or a clarification from the programme owner, and can separately research the general Türkiye Bursları route.",{"children":"Original case: a Pakistani applicant seeking a master’s sees Pakistan in the document’s PhD section. They should not treat that entry as a master’s entitlement. They need the relevant degree section or a clarification from the programme owner, and can separately research the general Türkiye Bursları route."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://storagetbbsweb.blob.core.windows.net/tbbsweb/Contents/ListofCountriesProgramsandDepartments.pdf",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://storagetbbsweb.blob.core.windows.net/tbbsweb/Contents/ListofCountriesProgramsandDepartments.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"YTB-linked country, level and programme attachment"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Check country eligibility at the degree level","children":[["$","$L4","/scholarships/turkiye-burslari/",{"href":"/scholarships/turkiye-burslari/","children":["General Türkiye Bursları route",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","2-Funding coverage: read the joint award’s own terms",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Funding coverage: read the joint award’s own terms"}],[["$","p","The 2026 notice describes tuition, monthly support, accommodation support, insurance, a Turkish-language year and specified round-trip travel. It does not make every feature of a different IsDB scheme applicable to this route.",{"children":"The 2026 notice describes tuition, monthly support, accommodation support, insurance, a Turkish-language year and specified round-trip travel. It does not make every feature of a different IsDB scheme applicable to this route."}],"$L22"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L23","$undefined"]}],"$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27"]}]
